      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR MAGNUS (3) landed midfield last time out and ended up 2.7L off the winner at Pinjarra last time out. Getting out over further looks no issue again now and the inside barrier is a big tick for his chances. Finds the right race to knock over his maiden now. OBSCENTINO (1) led them up over this track and trip last week and was only headed in the last stride as a $51 chance. He's had plenty of opportunities, but he rates highly on the back of his latest effort and he's sure to be in this for a long way yet again. DAISIESFORTHELADYS (7) is third-up now and getting back onto a firmer surface is a big tick for her chances. She's right out in trip now and if she can see out the journey, she'll give some cheek. GOING HARD (2) disappointed last time out but can improve coming back out to this distance and with the blinkers on. SYLVA JACK (4) won't be far away stepping out in trip.",
